WEBVTT

00:42.333 --> 00:44.502
Rui!

00:45.962 --> 00:46.963
Rui!

00:47.046 --> 00:48.757
What are you doing?

00:48.840 --> 00:50.842
You can't come out.

02:31.151 --> 02:33.194
I have a weak body.

02:33.695 --> 02:34.904
I was born that way.

02:36.781 --> 02:38.408
I never tried running before.

02:39.576 --> 02:42.328
Even walking was painful for me.

02:47.500 --> 02:50.628
Until Lord Muzan showed up.

02:54.340 --> 02:56.050
How pitiful.

02:56.134 --> 02:58.303
I shall save you.

03:03.933 --> 03:06.644
My parents were not happy at all.

03:10.064 --> 03:12.483
Although I was no longer weak,

03:12.984 --> 03:14.819
I couldn't be under the sun

03:15.528 --> 03:18.281
and I needed to consume human flesh.

03:23.411 --> 03:25.121
How could this happen?

03:25.204 --> 03:28.708
Look at what you have done, Rui!

03:36.382 --> 03:39.761
I once heard a wonderful story.

03:43.598 --> 03:46.601
To save his drowning son in the river,

03:46.684 --> 03:48.436
the father paid with his life ultimately.

03:54.817 --> 03:56.736
I was really touched.

03:56.819 --> 04:00.406
How noble fatherly love is
and the bond between family.

04:01.532 --> 04:06.246
The father who perished in the river
fulfilled his duty as a father perfectly.

04:07.830 --> 04:08.998
But…

04:09.874 --> 04:11.709
What my dad wanted was…

04:17.799 --> 04:22.303
My dad wanted to kill me.

04:23.972 --> 04:25.932
My mom only cried at the side.

04:26.015 --> 04:28.810
She didn't try to protect me
from being killed.

04:42.949 --> 04:44.701
Everything was fake, wasn't it?

04:46.536 --> 04:50.123
The bond we shared between us wasn't real.

04:52.583 --> 04:55.378
I'm sorry.

04:57.505 --> 04:59.215
It seemed like she said something.

05:00.091 --> 05:01.676
Could she still be alive?

05:02.677 --> 05:07.098
I failed to give you a strong body.

05:07.181 --> 05:08.349
I'm sorry.

05:10.310 --> 05:13.980
After finishing that sentence,
my mom stopped breathing.

05:15.982 --> 05:17.066
She died.

05:18.776 --> 05:20.695
It's okay, Rui.

05:21.321 --> 05:23.614
We'll die with you.

05:25.116 --> 05:27.327
Driven by the anger
of almost being killed,

05:27.410 --> 05:29.620
I couldn't understand my dad's words.

05:30.330 --> 05:34.834
But my dad wanted to be the scapegoat
of all the homicides I committed

05:34.917 --> 05:36.711
and die together with me.

05:37.670 --> 05:40.840
At that moment, I suddenly understand…

05:47.430 --> 05:49.140
what a true bond signifies.

05:49.807 --> 05:53.770
However, on that night,
I severed it with my own hands.

05:55.813 --> 05:56.898
Even so,

05:57.899 --> 06:01.402
Lord Muzan still encouraged me.

06:03.029 --> 06:07.241
Your parents' inability to accept you
lies at the root of this problem.

06:07.325 --> 06:09.619
You need to be proud of your strength.

06:11.245 --> 06:13.081
Other than accepting what he said,

06:13.164 --> 06:17.794
I couldn't stand
what my hopeless self did.

06:22.340 --> 06:25.343
Even though I knew I was at fault…

06:34.102 --> 06:35.812
Day by day,

06:36.437 --> 06:39.190
I couldn't stop missing my parents.

06:40.942 --> 06:43.069
Even though I created a pretend family,

06:43.736 --> 06:45.404
I couldn't fill the hollowness inside me.

06:46.155 --> 06:48.491
In the end, I was too strong.

06:49.033 --> 06:52.328
Nobody could protect or shield me.

06:53.204 --> 06:55.039
The stronger I got,

06:55.957 --> 06:58.501
the memory I got
when I was a human got blurrier.

07:00.002 --> 07:02.088
What I wanted to do

07:02.588 --> 07:04.173
was getting unclear.

07:12.974 --> 07:15.351
No matter what I do,
I couldn't get it anymore.

07:15.435 --> 07:19.689
In search of a bond,
I tried really hard to reach out,

07:19.772 --> 07:21.315
but I could touch nothing.

07:32.743 --> 07:34.579
Inside his small body,

07:35.204 --> 07:39.041
there's a smell of massive sadness
that he couldn't withstand.

07:56.934 --> 07:58.186
How warm.

07:59.479 --> 08:01.939
A warm hand just like the sunlight.

08:05.860 --> 08:07.195
I remember now.

08:07.278 --> 08:08.446
It's so clear.

08:09.071 --> 08:10.907
I really wanted to apologize.

08:11.991 --> 08:13.242
I'm sorry.

08:13.910 --> 08:17.121
Everything was my fault.

08:19.332 --> 08:21.584
Please forgive me.

08:23.002 --> 08:28.341
But a serial killer like me
will probably go to hell.

08:30.009 --> 08:32.220
Dad, Mom, and I

08:32.970 --> 08:35.806
are going to different places, aren't we?

08:37.725 --> 08:39.393
That's not true.

08:41.145 --> 08:43.147
Let's go together.

08:43.231 --> 08:44.482
Even if it's hell.

08:49.445 --> 08:50.488
Rui.

08:52.198 --> 08:53.366
Dad.

08:55.117 --> 08:56.285
Mom.

08:57.745 --> 08:58.829
Rui.

08:59.747 --> 09:01.499
We'll always be together wherever we go.

09:12.176 --> 09:15.388
Everything was my fault.

09:16.013 --> 09:17.515
I'm sorry.

09:18.641 --> 09:23.521
I'm sorry!

09:46.168 --> 09:49.422
Don't take pity on a man-eating demon.

09:50.131 --> 09:52.717
Even if they looked like children.

09:53.426 --> 09:57.263
He was an ugly monster
who has lived for decades.

09:57.847 --> 10:00.683
For the victims to rest in peace,

10:01.475 --> 10:03.894
so that nobody will be harmed again,

10:04.687 --> 10:08.858
I'll still swing my sword
at the demon's neck without leniency.

10:09.734 --> 10:13.029
But the pain they feel as a demon,

10:13.112 --> 10:15.698
the regret they feel for their actions,

10:15.781 --> 10:17.533
I won't tread on them

10:18.284 --> 10:20.244
because demons were once humans.

10:21.579 --> 10:24.457
Just like myself, they were once humans.

10:25.750 --> 10:27.752
Please remove your feet!

10:29.545 --> 10:31.881
He wasn't an ugly monster.

10:32.590 --> 10:34.425
Demons are hollow creatures.

10:35.009 --> 10:36.594
They are sad creatures.

10:50.066 --> 10:51.150
You're…

10:59.992 --> 11:00.868
What?

11:05.456 --> 11:08.417
Why did you stop me, Mr. Tomioka?

11:09.543 --> 11:13.339
You clearly said before
that you won't get along with demons.

11:13.422 --> 11:14.840
What's going on now?

11:16.092 --> 11:17.635
You're always like this.

11:17.718 --> 11:20.054
That's why everyone hates you.

11:38.072 --> 11:39.907
The medicine is so effective.

11:39.990 --> 11:41.867
Lady Kocho's antidote serum.

11:41.951 --> 11:43.077
Yes.

11:43.160 --> 11:46.455
Plus, she mixed the concoction
in an instant after gauging the situation.

11:47.206 --> 11:48.874
She's really amazing.

11:49.959 --> 11:51.210
That guy too.

11:52.294 --> 11:54.130
Do you mean him?

11:54.213 --> 11:56.632
Thanks to him for defeating the demon,

11:56.715 --> 11:59.343
the toxin circulation is reduced,
albeit slightly.

12:00.928 --> 12:03.139
All right, this should be enough.

12:03.973 --> 12:05.766
Everything is going smoothly.

12:05.850 --> 12:08.060
At this rate, everyone can be saved.

12:08.144 --> 12:11.021
But we must finish our work quickly.

12:11.105 --> 12:13.524
I want to leave this place
as soon so possible.

12:13.607 --> 12:14.775
I know.

12:14.859 --> 12:18.571
Because this place is really smelly.

12:26.829 --> 12:29.999
Mr. Tomioka, please move aside.

12:32.376 --> 12:33.461
I…

12:34.503 --> 12:36.297
I'm not disliked by people.

12:39.508 --> 12:42.595
Well, I'm very sorry then.

12:42.678 --> 12:45.598
It seems that you don't know
people hate you.

12:45.681 --> 12:48.726
I'm such a bigmouth. Please forgive me.

12:55.357 --> 12:56.525
Yes!

12:56.609 --> 12:59.361
The one you're hugging is a demon.

12:59.445 --> 13:01.906
It's very dangerous.
Please stay away from her.

13:01.989 --> 13:04.033
You're wrong.

13:04.116 --> 13:05.659
No, you're right.

13:05.743 --> 13:08.454
Well, she's my younger sister.

13:08.537 --> 13:09.955
She's my younger sister.

13:10.039 --> 13:10.915
So…

13:12.458 --> 13:15.169
I see. You're so pitiful.

13:16.045 --> 13:17.296
Well…

13:17.379 --> 13:19.048
I won't let her suffer any pain.

13:19.131 --> 13:21.926
I'll help you kill her
with a gentle poison.

13:25.054 --> 13:26.222
Can you still move?

13:27.890 --> 13:30.184
Even if you can't move,
you better move with your will.

13:30.935 --> 13:32.561
Carry your sister and run now.

13:33.437 --> 13:34.647
Mr. Tomioka.

13:35.731 --> 13:36.857
I'm sorry.

13:36.941 --> 13:38.275
Thank you very much!

13:40.611 --> 13:43.531
What you did is against
the corps' rules, right?

13:55.626 --> 13:58.212
My whole body is so painful
and uncomfortable.

13:58.295 --> 13:59.838
I feel like screaming my lungs out.

13:59.922 --> 14:01.048
Keep going.

14:01.966 --> 14:04.843
Keep going!

14:09.181 --> 14:12.935
I guess I have no choice,
but to leave Demon Slayer Corps.

14:13.644 --> 14:15.437
Although she's my biological sister,

14:15.521 --> 14:18.607
a swordsman accompanied by a demon
will never be accepted.

14:22.862 --> 14:25.447
Are you serious, Mr. Tomioka?

14:25.531 --> 14:28.242
I can't believe a Hashira
will protect a demon.

14:31.829 --> 14:33.831
Although you have the intention to do so,

14:33.914 --> 14:37.710
I don't want to accompany you
and waste my time.

14:37.793 --> 14:39.920
Well, have a good day.

14:51.181 --> 14:53.851
Do you plan to catch up with me?

15:02.234 --> 15:05.529
I don't mind you stopping me,

15:05.613 --> 15:08.198
but don't forget about the other person.

15:15.831 --> 15:17.333
My legs can't stop.

15:17.416 --> 15:19.168
I must force my body to move.

15:19.251 --> 15:21.503
I must run as far as I can.

15:29.261 --> 15:31.555
Shit. What's this?

15:31.639 --> 15:33.641
I used up all my energy on running.

15:34.558 --> 15:35.517
Nezuko.

15:37.019 --> 15:38.187
Demon Slayer Corps.

15:44.234 --> 15:46.070
Run, Nezuko!

15:46.153 --> 15:48.072
Hurry up, run!

15:48.155 --> 15:49.657
Don't let them catch you!

15:49.740 --> 15:50.658
Hurry--

16:01.335 --> 16:04.046
Her body shrunk
and she turned into a child.

16:13.430 --> 16:16.725
She keeps on running,
but she doesn't attack me.

16:16.809 --> 16:17.935
What's going on?

16:21.355 --> 16:23.273
It doesn't matter anyway.

16:23.357 --> 16:25.859
I only have to slay
this demon as instructed.

16:28.904 --> 16:30.614
Mr. Tomioka.

16:30.698 --> 16:32.825
Are you listening to me, Mr. Tomioka?

16:33.659 --> 16:37.621
To chase after the demon,
my attacks are justified.

16:37.705 --> 16:40.290
I don't think I went against the rules.

16:40.958 --> 16:43.836
But your action is against the corps rules

16:44.336 --> 16:47.214
because you got in the way
of a demon-slaying task.

16:47.297 --> 16:49.091
What do you plan to achieve by doing so?

16:52.970 --> 16:55.597
Please open your mouth and talk to me.

16:55.681 --> 16:57.725
This is my final ultimatum.

16:57.808 --> 16:59.935
At the very least, tell me your reason.

17:06.066 --> 17:09.236
I remembered it was two years ago.

17:09.319 --> 17:12.740
I don't think you should start
your story from so long ago.

17:12.823 --> 17:14.324
Are you doing this on purpose?

17:14.825 --> 17:18.454
Are you holding a grudge
because I said people hate you?

17:23.542 --> 17:25.461
Listen up!

17:27.004 --> 17:29.006
An order from the headquarters.

17:29.882 --> 17:31.425
Capture Tanjiro and Nezuko.

17:31.508 --> 17:34.762
Bring them back
to the headquarters immediately!

17:37.681 --> 17:40.517
Tanjiro and the demon, Nezuko,

17:40.601 --> 17:43.312
capture them and bring them back
to the headquarters instantly!

17:43.395 --> 17:46.982
Tanjiro is wearing a thigh-length kimono
with a checkered pattern.

17:47.066 --> 17:48.859
There's a scar on his forehead.

17:48.942 --> 17:51.653
Nezuko is a young and female demon
biting a bamboo tube.

17:51.737 --> 17:52.780
Bring them back instantly.

17:52.863 --> 17:54.990
-Are you Nezuko?
-Bring them back instantly!

17:59.411 --> 18:01.705
Bring them back instantly!

18:03.082 --> 18:06.001
Tanjiro is wearing a thigh-length kimono
with a checkered pattern.

18:06.085 --> 18:07.669
There's a scar on his forehead.

18:07.753 --> 18:11.256
Nezuko is a young and female demon
biting a bamboo tube.

18:11.340 --> 18:13.717
Bring them back instantly!

18:17.513 --> 18:19.014
There's a scar on his forehead.

18:19.098 --> 18:20.849
All right, let's capture him.

18:21.683 --> 18:24.603
Did he break his jawbone?

18:26.188 --> 18:28.315
How pitiful. Now, he has to be tied up.

18:32.569 --> 18:33.821
What's wrong with this guy?

18:33.904 --> 18:37.074
I don't know. I don't think he's a demon.

18:37.574 --> 18:38.909
Is he a human?

18:39.701 --> 18:41.662
He's wearing the corps uniform.

18:43.455 --> 18:45.541
It's just a mask. He's human.

18:46.208 --> 18:47.835
All right, let's bring him back.

18:49.378 --> 18:52.548
Wow, he has some serious injuries.

18:52.631 --> 18:54.675
But why is he hung here?

18:57.427 --> 18:59.429
I couldn't do anything.

19:01.098 --> 19:05.144
With my own strength,
I can't even defeat a single demon.

19:07.646 --> 19:11.191
Maybe I wasn't the strongest.

19:18.866 --> 19:20.200
TREATMENT COMPLETED

19:20.284 --> 19:22.494
Layer by layer, they wrapped me up.

19:23.745 --> 19:25.164
Who are they?

19:25.747 --> 19:28.667
They are surely quick
at doing this clean-up.

19:29.626 --> 19:31.086
Also, that girl.

19:31.170 --> 19:33.422
Isn't she the girl from Final Selection?

19:34.006 --> 19:37.718
Her hairband looks very similar
to the lady who wrapped us up.

19:38.677 --> 19:40.429
Do we send these people
to Butterfly Estate?

19:40.512 --> 19:43.265
Yes, send all the injured personnel
to our place.

19:43.348 --> 19:45.392
I'll be responsible
for hunting down the demons nearby.

19:45.475 --> 19:46.977
You guys can work in peace.

19:48.145 --> 19:50.314
By the way, I heard about them before.

19:50.397 --> 19:52.441
A cleanup unit of the corps, Kakushi.

19:53.233 --> 19:56.612
After Demon Slayer Corps' battle
with demons, they will do the clean-up.

19:57.779 --> 20:02.576
The members comprise of people
who lack swordsmanship and talent.

20:03.619 --> 20:05.621
TREATMENT COMPLETED

20:10.584 --> 20:11.710
The sun is up.

20:57.339 --> 20:58.590
Wake up.

20:59.716 --> 21:01.301
Hey, wake up now.

21:01.927 --> 21:03.095
Wake up.

21:03.178 --> 21:05.305
Hey, do you hear me?

21:05.389 --> 21:07.599
Hey, damn you!

21:07.683 --> 21:09.476
How long are you going to sleep?

21:09.559 --> 21:11.144
You better wake up now!

21:15.482 --> 21:17.234
The Hashiras are standing in front of you.

22:52.287 --> 22:56.041
I have recently been assigned
to the same mission as you, Mr. Tomioka.

22:57.375 --> 22:59.211
Please reply to me at least.

22:59.294 --> 23:02.964
Or are you still angry at me
for saying that you're hated?

23:04.382 --> 23:06.218
Could you please say something?

23:06.802 --> 23:08.804
A little gossip from the Taisho era.

23:08.887 --> 23:13.266
I heard Kocho fears cats, dogs,
and any creatures covered in fur.

23:13.350 --> 23:16.228
What are you saying out of the blue?

23:16.311 --> 23:18.647
Since you didn't deny it,
am I telling the truth then?

23:18.730 --> 23:21.733
You talk too much so everyone hates you.

23:21.817 --> 23:23.360
-I'm--
-"Not disliked by people."

23:23.443 --> 23:25.737
Please change your lines.

23:25.821 --> 23:28.323
Next, episode 22, "Master of the Mansion."

23:28.406 --> 23:29.366
TO BE CONTINUED

23:29.449 --> 23:30.450
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
